Detailed Results of 2016 Population By-census   
 
 
1 
Analysis of Results 
1.  Population 
Total population of Macao was 650,834 in August 2016, an increase of 98,331 or 17.8% as compared with 2011.  
Population size increased significantly as against 4 14,128 in 1996. During the past 20 years, the most rapid 
population growth was observed between 2011 and 201 6, up by 17.8% in five years (an average annual gro wth rate of 
3.3%). This was mainly due to a substantial increas e in non-resident workers living in Macao and a reb ound in the birth 
rate over the past five years. 
