Total population comprises local population, non-re sident workers and foreign students living in Macao . Local 
population totalled 537,018 in August 2016, up by 10 .7% from 2011. Non-resident workers and foreign stu dents living in 
Macao totalled 104,464 and 9,352, up by 67.7% and 8 9.2% respectively, together accounting for 17.5% of  the total 
population. 
